  "name": "Whirling Advance describes its native charges and recharge at every rank (#4918)",
  "contract": "The installed SpellCharges.dbc links every Whirling Advance rank to category 662. SpellChargesCategory.dbc defines that category as two charges with a 6000 ms serial recharge. Spell.dbc has no ordinary cooldown and none of the six descriptions mentions charges or recharge. Rank one and rank six are trained with native learnSpell fixtures; ordinary untriggered casts must consume both charges, remain empty before six seconds, then recover one charge and finally both without fixtures. SMSG_PATCH_SPELL must carry the missing charge and recharge information for all six ranks while preserving the damage formula and root restriction. Runeshroud is a positive control for the shared text stream. These observations cover server delivery; graphical client rendering is not available.",
